# Docker build context excludes (P0-PLAT-01 / B-030).
# Both apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile build from the repo root
# (`COPY . .`), so anything not needed to `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` +
# build a workspace must be stripped here — otherwise the host node_modules is
# copied in and `pnpm install` fails with ERR_PNPM_ABORTED_REMOVE_MODULES_DIR_NO_TTY.
# Keep: every package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, pnpm-workspace.yaml, and workspace src.

# --- dependencies (reinstalled inside the image) ---
node_modules
**/node_modules

# --- VCS / agent metadata ---
.git
.gitignore
.worktrees
.claude

# --- build outputs & caches (regenerated in the build stage) ---
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
.turbo
**/.turbo

# --- test artifacts (generated at run time) ---
coverage
**/coverage
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
test-results
**/test-results

# --- secrets & env (never bake into an image; .env.example is harmless but unneeded) ---
.env
.env.*

# --- OS / logs / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.log

# --- read-only reference sources (not tracked; huge — never needed in an image) ---
pototype
design_handoff_juneflow
juneflow-extract

# --- investor deck assets + strays (B-006) ---
*.pptx
*.pdf
clear_layout_assets
deck_assets_glam

# --- CI / docs / process files (irrelevant to building a workspace) ---
.github
agents
*.md
